{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"No disrespect meant, m'lord.\" Kiln chuckles.","created_at":"2020-08-03T04:52:00.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739707119955214336","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"He hands it back","created_at":"2020-08-03T04:52:08.261000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739707152544825476","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"None taken\" he says hoarsely, then takes as swig from a waterskin","created_at":"2020-08-03T04:52:24.650000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-03T04:52:58.004000Z","id":"739707221285404743","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"So what finds ye outside o tha town this eve?\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T04:53:20.476000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739707455436750900","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"With what little patrols we have going on, I thought it right to check the perimeter myself\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T04:53:56.968000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739707608495030274","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Good on ye, find anythin goin bump in tha night?\" Kiln pops her eyebrows to accentuate 'bump.'","created_at":"2020-08-03T04:56:11.689000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739708173555859486","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Rigatony chuckles \"Naught but your fire, it was hard to miss\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T04:57:12.467000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739708428477268009","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"What maybe green flames are all tha rage here in this New Arcania?!\" Kiln smirks.","created_at":"2020-08-03T04:59:23.879000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739708979659407400","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Its strange that we're here.\" Kiln flops onto her back and stares at the sky.","created_at":"2020-08-03T04:59:59.192000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739709127772864562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Indeed it is\" He sits down, criss-cross. \"A confusing time to be sure.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:01:04.534000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739709401836814366","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"What I find I fear most, Is my own lack of fear.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:02:42.073000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739709810945032234","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"The others become so emotionally distraught at every turn, it feels... odd, to be a pillar of indifference amidst the storm\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:03:17.918000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739709961289990221","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"I'm sure there'll be plenty ta tug at yer heart strings, eventu'lly.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:04:57.106000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739710377314615339","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Does seem like e'ery week there is some sort a traumatic event...strange.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:05:58.635000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739710635386077205","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Riga smiles a sad smile, \"I feel like my heart has been played out.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:06:23.809000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739710740973223977","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"I feel their pain you know\" he waves to the shade beneath the trees","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:06:39.366000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739710806224011315","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Their joy, hopes, and pains\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:06:51.331000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739710856408858674","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"The shades seem magnetized to the green flame of Osiris","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:07:14.175000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739710952223539200","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"it flickers towards them","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:07:20.237000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739710977649672234","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
