{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"You know, Miss Baker, you are welcome to come to town and associate with the colonists. Some of us, er, well, we could use a Diplomat around\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:28:06.522000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739716204947701791","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Been by yerself tha whole time?\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:28:26.412000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739716288372539393","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"(You know that the last ship that tried to come to this Island was blocked by Koi, 15 years ago...)","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:29:11.108000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739716475841019915","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Not entirely. I've met some natives.. and I also have Viola, she saved me when the ship crashed.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:29:43.809000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739716612999086132","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"But that's why I find it so interesting that you are all here building a town. And well. I've missed home and some of you remind me of it.\" She glances over to Kiln","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:31:09.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739716972496814171","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Riga straightens his back, trying to tune out the constant hum of his sword, \"Do you know much about the island Miss Baker?\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:33:16.734000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739717506071265302","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
